                                                "sense_id": "d506af4d-4fb1-3c6c-b755-8703762856b3",
                                                "text": "The United team includes five England internationals."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b9b5a2d-a3da-42af-9d48-225bace9628d",
                                                "sense_id": "d506af4d-4fb1-3c6c-b755-8703762856b3",
                                                "text": "\"The young fellah meant no real harm. After all, he's an International, so if he takes half an hour to describe a game of football he has more right to do it than most folk.\""
